OL,3,GNEWSA'Never too old to start' - meet
OL,4,Athe late starters shining in new sports
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanley Hamilton is among the most
OL,7,Fhighly-decorated arm wrestlers in
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland, but what makes his
OL,9,Fsuccess all the more remarkable is that
OL,10,Fhe only got to grips with the sport in
OL,11,Fhis 40s.
OL,13,FHis rise to the top has been rapid,
OL,14,Ffrom absolute beginner to a world
OL,15,Fbeater in less than a decade.
OL,17,FIt is more common for people to achieve
OL,18,Fpeak performance in their youth, but
OL,19,FStanley is far from alone in
OL,20,Fdiscovering a competitive edge later in
OL,21,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
